  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "船（厨房）",
    "id": "2058",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「さぁさぁ、皆さんお立ち会い！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「聞くも涙、語るも涙の超大作！　全米が泣くにちがいない、状況説明を始めましょう☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はうう……余計な前口上はいいから、ふつうに説明してほしいですよぅ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ＯＫピヨちゃん！　了解ですぜ！　任せてください！　むっふっふ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「えっとですね。うちの陸上部はこの連休中、波止場の近所で合宿をしております！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ここまでは、ＯＫですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あっ、はい。そういえば、波止場の近所には君咲学院が運営する合宿所があるんですよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「そうです！　費用もかかるし手続きが大変なので、あんまり利用されてませんけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「うちの陸上部のアニキは手続き大好き人間なので、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「連休中は合宿所が利用できるようになったんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「生徒会の役員だと、学院側もすんなり許可してくれるらしくて～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「それで今朝から、陸上部の合宿が始まったんですけどね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「最初にかるく準備運動、という感じで『けいどろ』をやることになったんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「『けいどろ』……っていうとあの、ルールを複雑にした鬼ごっこみたいなやつですよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「そうですそうです、ピヨちゃんかしこい！　よぉし、よし♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あうぅ、だから揺らさないで～？　ゲロっちゃいますぅ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ともあれ、『けいどろ』はフィジカルを鍛えるのに有用な遊び！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「基本的に個人競技である陸上において貴重な、『チームワーク』を育む訓練にもなりますね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ゆえに陸上部の合宿では毎年、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「各々の競技の個人練習に入る前は『けいどろ』をして親睦を深めるみたいです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしも張りきりましたよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「他の連中に、あっしの優秀さを見せつけるチャンスですからね～！　むっふっふ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ちなみに『けいどろ』は追う側……警察役を『三年生チーム』が、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「追われる側……泥棒役を『一年生・二年生の混成チーム』が、それぞれ担当したんですけどね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「うちの三年生は優秀なものの人数がすくないので、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしら一年生・二年生が圧倒的に有利なはずでした！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「勝った！　第三部完！　などと、思いましたけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「勝ったチームは負けたチームに合宿中、完全服従するという取り決めでしたし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしは必ず勝利して、部長の地位をゲットするつもりでした！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「だから、本気で勝ちにいったんですけどね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしは、陸上部の先輩たちを侮ってました……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「アネゴは、本気で容赦なく狩りにくるし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「アニキは親身に優しく接してくれるから、囚人が監獄から出てこなくなる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっという間に一年生・二年生は次々と狩られ、監獄でアニキと優雅にお茶を楽しむ始末！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「残るは、あっしだけになりました！　べべん、べんべべん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「その無駄な擬音は何？　三味線……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「しかし、あっしは是が非でも勝ちたかった！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「監獄にいる同学年の仲間たちは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「『さっさと諦めて、こっちでお茶とお菓子を楽しもう♪』とか言ってきたんですけど！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしは、あんな腑抜けどもとはちがう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「部長の地位を得るための千載一遇の好機を、絶対に逃したくはなかったんですぜ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「思いつめたあっしは孤軍奮闘しましたが、ついにアネゴに海辺まで追いつめられ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「咄嗟に、海に飛びこんで難を逃れました！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「本物の泥棒というか、逃亡犯みたいなことしますね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「むっふっふ☆　アネゴは陸上に特化した陸上大好き人間なので、たぶん泳ぐのは苦手！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「それに海に飛びこめば水で体臭とかも消えるから、尾行もまける！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「そう判断したんですが、あっしは忘れてました！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしも、泳ぎはぜんぜん得意ではないということを！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「えっとぉ、もうちょっと後先のことを考えたほうがいいと思いますよ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「あっしもそう思いますが、ついカッとなって！　いまは反省しています！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ともあれ、あっしはあわや海の藻屑となりかけて～？　べべん、べん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「溺れ死にしそうだったところで、皆さんがあっしを釣りあげてくれたわけです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「ふたりとも、あっしの命の恩人ですぜ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「このご恩には、命をかけて報いる！　それが、あっしの任侠道……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「任侠道？　榊さ……ぶちょうさんは、独特の言い回しをしますね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 68,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -12,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「他に表現の仕様がない！　あっしはピヨちゃんとジョンくんに、でっかい恩をもらいました！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "むつみ",
    "text": "「それを返すまでは、あっしは死んでも死にきれません！」"
  },
  {
